<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica gasoline prices to rise by three cts/litre.</title>
<headline>SAfrica gasoline prices to rise by three cts/litre.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Central Energy Fund said gasoline prices would rise by three cents per litre and diesel would rise by four cents with effect from January 1.</p>
<p>Illuminating paraffin would rise by eight cents per litre.</p>
</text>
